WEBVTT

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.320
Our club activities start today, huh?!

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:11.610
Darn it! Had I known the
Scouts were an unauthorized club,

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.820
I would've joined
whatever club seemed decent.

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:15.490
That was a shock, wasn't it?

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.290
I wonder what kind of activities
the Wall Cleanup Club does.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.500
It's exciting, isn't it?

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.540
In any case, it's gotten hot lately.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.830
Summer is around the corner, isn't it?

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.290
Hey, Armin...

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.670
Hm?

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.300
Don't you feel hot in that?

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.680
I'm fine.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.010
To tell you the truth...

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.640
...this is made of mesh.

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:09.690
Period 4
Cleanup! Titan Junior High School

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.860
Levi made this hood for me!

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:14.900
He did?

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.450
What's the matter, Eren?

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:18.030
Forget the hood.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.910
What the hell is the Wall Cleanup Club?!

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:24.200
I don't get it! I wanna quit now! Right now!

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:29.330
I have to get strong in order to
fight Titans as soon as possible, dammit!

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:33.630
Even if you quit, they'll put you
in a different club right away.

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:37.300
It's not good to quit before you find out
what the Wall Cleanup Club is about.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:41.180
Plus, the popular clubs are
probably completely full by now.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:44.310
I should've joined the "going-home club."

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:46.940
A club admission form for
that club won't be accepted, either.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.070
What?! Is the "going-home club" also
a shadowy organization like the Scouts?!

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.570
I don't know...

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:56.360
This is no time for playing house,
Year 1 students!

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.820
Who are you?!

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.040
Welcome, Year 1 students!

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.330
I'm Rico Brzenska, the president
of the Wall Cleanup Club.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.330
I'll put you through the mill. Better keep up!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:12.960
Hm?

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.630
Excuse me, but what's this?

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:19.180
A whole set of equipment for
each of you. Use with great care!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.680
Th-This is just ordinary cleaning equipment...

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:23.310
Eren! Get a hold of yourself!

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:26.850
There were 100 members
when the Wall Cleanup Club was founded,

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.640
but I'm the only member right now.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:32.520
The club's survival depends
on you Year 1 students.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.780
I'll train you rigorously! Be prepared!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.400
Ouch! Ow, ow, ow...! Ow, ow, ow...!

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:43.240
Well... You Year 1 students will start
by cleaning all the windows in school!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:47.080
Cleaning windows?! That's no different
from being given cleaning duty!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.790
If you don't like it, transfer to a different club.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.420
However, all the human clubs
have reached their capacity.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.010
So you'll have no choice
but to join a Titan club.

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:01.590
What do you wanna do? I won't stop you.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.220
She's right. We have no choice
but to do the cleaning.

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:06.390
Tsk.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.140
Start with the new building!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.390
Don't you dare slack off!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:11.850
<b>Chee-bur
Potato</b>

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:12.270
<b>Fried Chicken</b>

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.100
With my original plan,

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:13.310
<b>Fried Chicken
Chee-bur
Potato</b>

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:17.110
I would've been fighting Titans
as a Scouts member by now...

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:17.320
<b>Fried Chicken
Chee-bur
Potato</b>

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:17.820
I'm hungry.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:18.740
<b>Potato</b>

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:18.940
<b>Fried Chicken
Potato</b>

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.780
So, what is the "going-home club," anyway?

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.740
<b>Fried Chicken</b>

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.570
Don't write what you want, you guys.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:23.780
<b>Fried Chicken</b>

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.990
You'll be scolded if you slack off.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.370
I envy those guys.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.710
Geez...

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.880
Compared to them, I'm...

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:41.800
Hm?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.760
I wonder why they're cleaning at this hour.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.470
Who knows. Maybe it's punishment
for forgetting their homework?

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.980
Seriously? What losers.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.270
Jean?

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:56.360
This is so stupid!

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.860
Hey! We're on the third floor!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.240
Hey, Jean! Don't slack off!

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:02.950
Ha!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.280
You just go on cleaning windows
for the rest of your life!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:07.240
You brat!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.660
Don't slack off, Year 1!

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:17.210
Ugh! Ahhhhh...!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:18.840
Ow!

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:25.430
It is your duty to clean all the windows
in school, which you must fulfill...

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:26.970
...no matter what.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:28.890
Rico!

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.850
That was super cool!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.640
You were flying! Flying!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.520
How does that work?!

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:35.900
- What's that?!
- Ouch!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.520
Oh, this?

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.480
This is the omni-directional mobility gear.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.440
It's our club's proud secret weapon.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.070
Like this...

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:49.030
...we use it to clean the wall.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.910
Whoa!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:55.500
If I use this, I might be able
to bring down the Titans!

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.840
If I use this, I might be able
to become very popular.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:02.010
Now, stop goofing around
and go back to cleaning the windows alrea—

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.340
Please let me use it, too!

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:05.260
Huh?

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:06.340
I'm the first!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.010
Don't imitate me!

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:09.850
Stop it, both of you.

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:11.010
Then, I'll go first.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.350
Don't be sneaky!

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:15.520
Th-They're a bunch of idiots...

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.440
I'm glad to see your enthusiasm,

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:28.570
but you won't be able to use the gear
until you can clean windows properly.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.950
Make a note of it in your childish minds,

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:34.120
and fulfill your responsibilities
as if your lives are at stake.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.790
If you've got that,
get back to window cleaning already!

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.540
We got scolded, didn't we?

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.210
Oh well... Let's get back to window cleaning.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.380
I get it...!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.300
Hm?

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:48.550
This means that if we can
do a good job cleaning the windows,

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.760
she'll let us use the gear!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:54.600
Then, I'll clean and clean
all the windows in school!

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.270
If that's how you feel,
Eren, I'll work hard, too.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.480
Hey, wait!

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.400
I'll do it, too!

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:01.360
Me, too!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.690
Okay! I'll do my best!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:03.690
"Boom!"

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.450
Damn those Year 1 students!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:10.950
How dare they take the
glorious Wall Cleanup Club lightly!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.830
How're you guys doing?
Is the window cleaning going—

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.750
What is this heavenly light?!

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.000
Rico!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.880
You guys...

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.090
Well done!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.930
Normally, only Year 2 and 3 students
are allowed to use the gear,

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:37.060
but I think you guys can handle it!

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:37.930
Then...!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.100
Yeah!

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.730
I'll train you guys so that
you'll be able to use the gear.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:44.320
All right!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.360
Huh?

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:51.820
What the hell...? How do I work this thing?!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.120
This can't be for real...

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:56.200
What are you doing, Eren Jaeger?!

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.790
Straighten yourself up!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.000
Just follow the basics
and you'll be able to do it.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:05.040
Y-You can do it if you stay calm.
Even I did it, after all.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.840
That's right. I'm going to do it! I am!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:10.880
I might not have raw aptitude...

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.890
...but no one has more guts than I do!

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:15.180
They're...

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.390
...my weapon!

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.100
Whoa!

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.690
I did it! I'm doing it!

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:26.770
Ahh!

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:28.740
Eren!

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.490
I've never seen anyone
with so little aptitude before.

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:35.070
Eren's got great athletic abilities, and yet...

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.620
If anything, I'd like to hear <i>your</i> trick...

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:43.170
...for staying sane after
putting on such a pathetic spectacle.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:48.000
Compared to you, I'm quicker
than anyone to have a good command of—

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:50.050
Yahoo!

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:51.720
I'm the first!

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:52.930
I'm going ahead!

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.350
You bastards! Dammit! Hold it!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:57.890
Damn those bastards!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.720
There's no point worrying about it.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.850
You can just learn to do it tomorrow.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:07.020
But operating the gear is the minimum
requirement for the Wall Cleanup Club.

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.480
What?! Then, what'll happen to Eren?!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:13.030
If he can't, he'll have to
leave the Wall Cleanup Club.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.530
What?!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:15.950
No! I can still—

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.990
Sorry, but the weak
have no choice but to leave.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.450
Oh, no...

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:22.750
I'm pathetic...

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:26.670
There's no way I can wipe them out like this!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:29.500
You should just forget about that altogether.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:30.710
What?!

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.260
I'm saying that you should give up
on having anything to do with Titans.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:37.930
Hey, now! I saw what happened that day!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:41.770
Do you really think you can
just convince me to give up?!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.350
Still, it doesn't matter
<i>how</i> determined you are.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.690
Huh? Why not?!

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:51.730
Because <i>you</i> don't get to decide
if you can stay in the Wall Cleanup Club.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.990
Setting Jean aside, even Conny can do it,

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.240
so it shouldn't have anything to do
with athletic ability or his brain.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.330
Is it possible that
the gear he's using is broken?

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:03.000
Nonsense!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:06.170
It took, believe it or not, 107 years for
our predecessors to develop this gear

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.130
by spending the entire club budget

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:11.130
as well as the money they saved by
not drinking juice on their way home!

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.210
They wanted to clean the wall that badly?!

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:16.260
So, there's no way that this gear,
a fruit of their blood, sweat and tears,

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:18.260
has any flaws!

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.760
If, by any chance, the gear is the cause,

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:24.020
I'll stand on my hands
and eat spaghetti from my nos—

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.770
Ah... Anyway you look at it, it's broken.

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:28.610
What's the matter?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.270
Ugh!

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.650
Is it possible...

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.990
...that Eren's gear has problems?

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.530
Oh, shoot!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.070
What am I gonna do?! What am I gonna do?!
What am I gonna do...?!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:42.040
What are you cryin' about, Eren?

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.790
Mr. Hannes!

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.000
Did Mikasa get on your case about somethin'?

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:48.500
Huh?! What makes you think I was crying?!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.080
Whoa, you reek of alcohol!

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:53.130
Hey, why're you here?!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:57.340
Why? That's because I'm the advisor
to the Wall Cleanup Club.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:58.970
Huh?! Seriously?!

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:02.180
Eren, give me that gear you're wearing.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:02.640
Uh-Uhm...

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:04.430
Sure, but can you use it?

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.980
Don't underestimate me, Eren.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:08.560
- Just how long do you think
- Excuse me...

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.610
I've been the advisor to the club?

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:11.650
Okay!

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:15.900
Now, Eren. I'll show you how to operate it!

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:21.030
Whoa, Mr. Hannes is amazing!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:24.160
So he wasn't just an ordinary drunk.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:27.290
What do you think, Eren?!
Do you think better of me now?!

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:33.460
You're playing dirty, you thieves!
I was the one who found that target first!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:37.340
Dirty? I didn't expect you
to be so naive, Jean.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.840
Do you need manners
when stealing someone's prey?

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.850
Don't bring your hunter's logic
into this, you potato girl!

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.470
Potato, you said?!

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.650
Mr. Hannes! Are you okay?!

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:54.860
Eren...

00:11:55.070 --> 00:12:00.660
You couldn't handle the gear
because you lacked the strength.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.120
Well, I started practicing just earlier.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.660
I crashed into the wall...

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.950
...because I'm drunk!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.250
You reek of alcohol!

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:10.790
Ahh!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:14.250
The gear is broken!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:16.500
Hm? You're right!

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:19.420
What do we do with you, Mr. Hannes?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.970
I'll fix it by tomorrow,
so we're dismissed for today. Dismissed!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.600
Why are you so rattled?

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:27.720
Shut up! I said, dismissed! Dismissed!

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.680
Go home already!

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:34.060
Eren Jaeger. Are you ready?

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:35.690
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:38.820
Huh?

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:43.450
I did it! I don't know why,
but I can suddenly do it!

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.070
I'm happy for you, Eren!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:46.620
You did it!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.540
Rico!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:48.200
Hm?!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.750
I can stay in the Wall Cleanup Club, right?!

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:54.040
Y-Yeah. You pass muster. Train hard!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.420
Whadya think of that, Mikasa?!

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:58.710
I can do it! I can fight the Titans!

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:02.090
You can finally stop pampering me!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:04.260
Looks like things worked out for him.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.640
His eyes say, "What do you think of that?!"

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:07.560
No.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:08.770
Hm?

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:14.310
He feels relieved that he can
clean the wall with me now.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.150
Hm?

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.900
Hey, hey, what the hell
are you doing all of a sudden?

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.450
I can hear a footstep-like
rumbling on the ground!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.120
Huh?

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.370
Everyone, move away from the wall!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:35.120
Titans're coming!

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:36.630
Stay put.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:39.840
What the hell are they doing?

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.300
What're they doing?

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:49.970
That's terrible.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.350
That's right...

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:56.150
This graffiti is the precise reason why
the Wall Cleanup Club was founded.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:59.320
Someone needed to remove the graffiti.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.820
There were some students

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:04.610
who couldn't put up with it
and started cleaning the wall voluntarily.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.490
Alyosha, Dominic, Fine,

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.490
Isabel, Ludwig, Martina,

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:12.660
Guido, and Hans...

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:15.160
They're the founders of the Wall Cleanup Club.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.710
Mikasa, give me that.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:19.840
Eren!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.550
Don't, Jaeger!

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:28.800
Did someone teach him how to use the gear?!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:38.190
I can do it! As long as I have
the gear, I can fight Titans!

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.150
Huh?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.200
Eren!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.500
How lame...

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:59.130
P-Practice sure is important, huh?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:03.380
What a stupid bum.
I have to train him from the start.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.760
You damn Titans!

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:11.300
I'm not gonna be defeated next time for sure!

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:14.970
<b>Soft-boiled Egg</b>

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>climb over that wall</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.200
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.700
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:39.420
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.510
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:00.190
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.730
<i>Even if our glory days of youth</i>
<i>get trampled upon,</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:16.240
<i>I won't give in to that</i>
<i>absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.340
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:33.140
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

00:16:46.570 --> 00:16:47.980
Test results...

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:48.280
Test Results
